      <p>No. 104, 2015</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Migration Act 1958</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 30 June 2015</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
